  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "保健室",
    "id": "34",
    "timezone": "1"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あら、転校生さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「どうかしたのですか、こんな早朝から？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「本日はバレンタインですし、さぞ転校生さんはお忙しいのではないですか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「というか普通に、一時限目が始まってしまう刻限ですよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「どこか、お身体の具合でもよろしくないのですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「などと、ひとの心配ができる立場でもありませんね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくし、こうしてベッドに横たわっているわけですし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふふ。わたくし、もう駄目かもしれません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「バレンタインを生き延びて明日を迎えられる気がいたしません、ぶっちゃけ天に召されそうです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「くるみちゃんと、約束をしたのでね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「あの子がつくるチョコを拒絶せずに食べつづけたのですよ。ここ一週間ほどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「今朝も、出会い頭に大量に食べさせられてしまいました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「くるみちゃんも、努力を重ねたのでしょう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「今朝、いただいたチョコは甘くておいしかったのですけど。量が、ものすごくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくし、ダウンしてしまったのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「その『甘くておいしいチョコ』に行きつくまでの、試作品の数々などは……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「それはもう、語るのもおぞましい代物でしたし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「うう、思いだすだけで寒気がいたします」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「そんなこんなで、わたくし聖ヴァレンティヌス様のように殉教しそうです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「愛のために死す。夢路まりあ、ここに眠る……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「うう。転校生さん、あまりこちらを見ないでくださいまし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「わたくし食べすぎて、お腹が『ぽっこり』しております」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「処女懐妊です、お恥ずかしい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「救世主を産む胎（はら）となれるなら、それもまた本望ですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「そうそう、救世主で思いだしましたけれど。本日は、くるみちゃんの誕生日のようなのですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「何か、お祝いをするべきでしょうかね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「せっかくなので、チョコを贈りましょうか～などとも思うのですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「正直なところ、わたくし今はチョコなど見たくもないのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「……あ、あぁっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「すみません。わたくし、ここ最近はくるみちゃんのチョコ攻撃に翻弄されており……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「転校生さんに、チョコをご用意するのを忘れておりました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「はあ……駄目ですね、わたくし。どうも、抜けております」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ともあれ。転校生さんは、どうして保健室にいらっしゃったのですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふむふむ、転校生さんもチョコの食べすぎでございますか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「やはり、おモテになるのですね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「それで、保健室に胃薬をもらいにきた……という感じでございますか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「では、わたくしがお薬をご用意いたしましょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ん、んん。どうも起きあがるのが、つらいです。お腹がいっぱいで、動けません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「転校生さん、薬箱はそこですから……ご自分でやっていただけますか？」"
  }
]